      wrap: false
    elementId: label-a
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [64, 156, 396, 140]
    elementId: box-a
    elementType: shape
    fill: {color: $beige, type: solid}
    shapeName: rect
  - bounds: [80, 170, 364, 116]
    content:
      fontFamily: MiSans, MiSans
      fontSize: 12
      color: $ink
      lineHeight: 1.7
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>向 5 家供应商询价同一批物料，收回来 7 个文件：</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px"><span style="color:$gray">一份 Excel、一份正式 PDF、一份扫描 PDF、一段微信消息文字、一张手机拍照图……</span></p>
    elementId: box-a-t
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [64, 316, 300, 16]
    content:
      style: $mono
      text: 人工比价 · 现状
      wrap: false
    elementId: label-b
    elementType: text
  - border: {color: $green, style: solid, width: 1}
    bounds: [64, 340, 396, 120]
    elementId: box-b
    elementType: shape
    shapeName: rect
  - bounds: [80, 354, 364, 96]
    content:
      fontFamily: MiSans, MiSans
      fontSize: 12
      color: $ink
      lineHeight: 1.7
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>&gt; 逐个打开文件，把物料、数量、单价、交期誊到一张表里</p>
        <p>&gt; 同一物料各家写法不同，对齐全靠肉眼</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px"><span style="color:$green">耗时半天起步，誊错一个数就可能选错供应商</span></p>
    elementId: box-b-t
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [500, 132, 396, 26]
    content:
      bold: true
      color: $ink
      fontFamily: MiSans, MiSans
      fontSize: 17
      text: 能不能把这整件事交给程序？
      wrap: false
    elementId: answer-title
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [500, 170, 396, 180]
    content:
      style: $body
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>· 把一个文件夹扔进来，<strong>每个文件视为一家供应商的一次报价</strong>；</p>
        <p style="margin-top:10px">· 不管什么格式，先统一成文本，再让 LLM 提取成<strong>统一的结构化数据</strong>；</p>
        <p style="margin-top:10px">· 同一物料跨供应商横向对齐，自动算均价、偏离度、缺报；</p>
        <p style="margin-top:10px">· 导出一张<strong>五色标色的比价 Excel</strong>，人只复核标黄的部分。</p>
    elementId: answer-body
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [500, 400, 396, 1]
    elementId: rule-r
    elementType: shape
    fill: {color: $line, type: solid}
    shapeName: rect
  - bounds: [500, 418, 396, 30]
    content:
      fontFamily: MiSans, MiSans
      fontSize: 15
      color: $ink
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>核心原则：<span style="color:$orange"><strong>允许出错，但不允许错了不告诉你。</strong></span></p>
      wrap: false
